# Documentation

## Canonical store documents

- `docs/technical-specification.md` — requirements / technical specification
- `docs/architecture-decisions.md` — accepted and open decisions
- `docs/trello-integration.md` — Trello integration and history limitations
- As the project grows: `analytics-metrics.md`, `database.md`, `api`/OpenAPI, `local-development.md`, `deployment.md`, `operations.md`

## Rules

- Update the relevant document when the related functionality changes.
- Do not use machine-absolute paths — only repository names and relative paths.
- Do not claim Trello history availability without experiment results.
- Document metric formulas and edge cases before or together with implementation.
- Comment non-trivial algorithms, API limits, and ambiguous events in code; do not comment the obvious.
